   "type": "Feature",
   "properties": {
    "name": "Area under Japanese or Mengjiang authority, 1942",
    "name_local": "蒙疆 / 蒙古自治邦",
    "year": 1942,
    "as_of": "Position at 31 December 1942, unchanged from 28 March 1940 to 11 August 1945",
    "authority": "Empire of Japan (Mongolia Garrison Army) and the Mengjiang United Autonomous Government, renamed 蒙古自治邦 internally on 31 August 1941",
    "control_note": "A single class. Along the Pingsui railway this meant garrisons, tax collection and a civil administration; on the Chahar, Shilingol and Ulanchab steppe it meant a Mongol banner office with a Japanese adviser and posts on the routes. The Daqingshan, inside the polygon north of the Guisui-Baotou railway, was Eighth Route Army guerrilla country throughout and is not cut out here.",
    "excluded": "The Hetao west of Baotou and the Ordos south of the Yellow River were listed in Mengjiang's administrative tables but never held, and lie outside this polygon. Wuyuan and Linhe were held only 3 February to 20 March 1940.",
    "base_geometry": "Suiyuan and Chahar provinces entire plus the North Shanxi counties, unioned. Modern East Asia GIS, China Provincial Boundaries, 1928-45 layer, WGS84.",
    "drawn_edges": "Four edges are drawn rather than surveyed: the inner Great Wall (Ningwu-Yanmen-Pingxing) as the southern limit of the North Shanxi counties; the Yellow River from Baotou east to the Hekou bend at Togtoh; a rounded cap west of Baotou; and the eastern limit, which follows the Mengjiang Regional Map rather than the boundary file, the latter carrying Chahar east over Fengning and Luanping, which were Rehe and so Manchukuo. Every other edge is a provincial boundary vertex for vertex, including the whole northern side, which is the border with Outer Mongolia.",
    "extent_source": "Mengjiang Regional Map (蒙疆地域圖), c. 1937-39",
    "compiled_from": "occupation-maps/range-report.md",
    "accuracy": "Illustrative, not a surveyed boundary: generalised from county and league membership. All 44 settlements listed as held in range-report.md fall inside it; all 17 negative controls fall outside."
   },
